{"id":"641920","name":"油条","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/641920/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"小苏打","amount":"3g"},{"name":"无铝泡打粉","amount":"3g"},{"name":"高糖酵母","amount":"3g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"g面粉➕2g小苏打+2g泡打粉➕5g糖➕3g盐。","img":"images/641920/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加适量温水调成粘稠糊状。","img":"images/641920/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"像这样盖盖子静置2小时以上。","img":"images/641920/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入酵母。","img":"images/641920/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/641920/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"最上面刷一层油盖盖子放冰箱冷藏发酵一宿。","img":"images/641920/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"早上起来将面团倒在铺好干粉的面板上。不要揉面。","img":"images/641920/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"表面撒点干粉就不粘手了。擀成长条。","img":"images/641920/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"切小段。","img":"images/641920/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"两个罗列在一起。","img":"images/641920/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"用筷子在中间压一下。","img":"images/641920/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拧上麻花劲。","img":"images/641920/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"下锅炸。","img":"images/641920/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"炸至金黄。","img":"images/641920/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"捞出装盘。","img":"images/641920/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"松软油条。","img":"images/641920/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"配上豆浆。","img":"images/641920/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"一起吃早餐吧！","img":"images/641920/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"冰箱里取出来的发酵后的面团，放置室温再加工更加蓬松。取出来以后不要揉面。直接打面粉整理形状。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}